+/*
+ * Two-wave fork of the coalescing fabric forwarder
+ * (dit_fused_norm_common/kernels/dataflow/dit_fused_norm_forwarder.cpp), used by
+ * DitFusedDistributedRmsnormMeshWorkloadFactory only for its two-wave row pipeline.
+ *
